BasicBluetoothPlaybackRecord: delay for record  For the path Cros device -&gt; BT module -&gt; Chameleon Line-In. BT module needs 2 seconds to initialize and plays analog data to Chameleon Line-In. Delay more time before recording from Chameleon Line-In.  BUG=chromium:541763 TEST=run the test, check playback_recorded.raw under results folder and see it does not contain artifacts in the beginning  Change-Id: I8590c04c7bdbe4d349fa3f17e418c054cc71d554 Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/305923 Commit-Ready: Cheng-Yi Chiang &lt;cychiang@chromium.org&gt; Tested-by: Cheng-Yi Chiang &lt;cychiang@chromium.org&gt; Reviewed-by: Hsinyu Chao &lt;hychao@chromium.org&gt; " fail_count="0" gerrit_number="305923" owner_email="cychiang@chromium.org" pass_count="0" patch_number="1" project="chromiumos/third_party/autotest" project_url="https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/chromiumos/third_party/autotest" ref="refs/changes/23/305923/1" remote="cros" total_fail_count="0"/><pending_commit branch="master" change_id="I3984f657aa588619802225435bf567550dc8b2ab" commit="7d602dc7282a0c5c34057fc96c058075f0c0ceb4" commit_message="[autotest] audio_AudioBasicBluetoothPlaybackRecord: Use lower freq filter  HSP/HFP playback is low-quality. Use a more powerful filter so we can get a better frequency estimation.  BUG=chromium:541763 TEST=run the test, check the estimated frequency of playback data changed from 458Hz to 439Hz, while the golden data is 440Hz.  Change-Id: I3984f657aa588619802225435bf567550dc8b2ab Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/305924 Commit-Ready: Cheng-Yi Chiang &lt;cychiang@chromium.org&gt; Tested-by: Cheng-Yi Chiang &lt;cychiang@chromium.org&gt; Reviewed-by: Hsinyu Chao &lt;hychao@chromium.org&gt; " fail_count="0" gerrit_number="305924" owner_email="cychiang@chromium.org" pass_count="0" patch_number="1" project="chromiumos/third_party/autotest" project_url="https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/chromiumos/third_party/autotest" ref="refs/