rg&gt; Reviewed-by: Nicolas Boichat &lt;drinkcat@chromium.org&gt; " fail_count="0" gerrit_number="269934" owner_email="djkurtz@chromium.org" pass_count="0" patch_number="62" project="chromiumos/third_party/kernel" project_url="https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/chromiumos/third_party/kernel" ref="refs/changes/34/269934/62" remote="cros" total_fail_count="0"/><pending_commit branch="chromeos-3.18" change_id="I014c64efb5eba927d322455de5b00b7e8e1dbf05" commit="0522d54e3e7448924f8b81734eeae25a646e2226" commit_message="CHROMIUM: config: mediatek: Enable DRM_POWERVR_ROGUE and DVFS  Enable the Imagination PowerVR Rogue GPU driver, and its Dynamic Voltage and Frequency (DVFS) option.  echo &quot;CONFIG_DRM_POWERVR_ROGUE=y CONFIG_DRM_POWERVR_ROGUE_DVFS=y&quot; \   &gt;&gt; chromeos/config/arm64/chromiumos-mediatek.flavour.config echo &quot;CONFIG_DRM_POWERVR_ROGUE=y CONFIG_DRM_POWERVR_ROGUE_DVFS=y&quot; \   &gt;&gt; chromeos/config/arm64/chromiumos-arm64.flavour.config chromeos/scripts/kernelconfig oldconfig   # select all defaults  Signed-off-by: Daniel Kurtz &lt;djkurtz@chromium.org&gt; Signed-off-by: Rufus Hamade &lt;rufus.hamade@imgtec.com&gt;  BUG=chrome-os-partner:40578 BUG=chrome-os-partner:45469 TEST=Boot oak-rev2 to UI, login and browse BBC website. TEST=Verify devfreq sysfs node and devfreq entries [1]:   ls -al /sys/class/devfreq/13000000.mfgsys-gpu/   [1] https://www.kernel.org/doc/Documentation/ABI/testing/sysfs-class-devfreq TEST=http://iacopoapps.appspot.com/hopalongwebgl/   =&gt; MTKSysSetVolt and MTKSysSetFreq logs in dmesg TEST=while ctrl-tab between hopalongwebgl and empty tab while doing:   watch -n 0.1 cat /sys/class/devfreq/13000000.mfgsys-gpu/cur_freq   =&gt; should alternate between high (494000) and low (253500) values  Change-Id: I014c64efb5eba927d322455de5b00b7e8e1dbf05 Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/269935 Commit-Ready: Daniel Kurtz &lt;djkurtz@chromium.org&gt; Tested-by: Daniel Kurtz &lt;djkurtz@chromium.org&gt; Revie